{"unit_id":"BiBoyang__dsh-eval-harness#card-zh","repo":"BiBoyang/dsh-eval-harness","commit":"2184ae446b7d1314b77ee618cd2e9d70300848b3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eval-harness 是面向 DSH 插件和 skill 作者的回归评测工具。它通过 DSH 工具接口注册 eval_run、eval_gate、eval_judge_validate 与 eval_tps_run。YAML 用例驱动 headless DSH 会话，采集 session trace、检查行为断言并生成 JSON 和 Markdown 报告；也支持 baseline 比较、可靠性试验与确定性 mock 故障测试。适合需要在 CI 中检查回归的开发者。需要 Node.js 和本机 DSH；启用 LLM judge 时需配置 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-20","src/runner.ts:833"]}
{"unit_id":"BiBoyang__dsh-eval-harness#card-en","repo":"BiBoyang/dsh-eval-harness","commit":"2184ae446b7d1314b77ee618cd2e9d70300848b3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-eval-harness runs YAML regression cases against headless DSH sessions, checks traces, and writes reports. It offers baseline gates, judge calibration, TPS measurements, reliability trials, and deterministic mock faults for CI. Requires Node.js and DSH; LLM judging needs an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-20","src/runner.ts:833"]}
